<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>게시글 수정</title>

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/style.css">
</head>
<body>

<header>

    <div class="login-area">

        <span>
            <%= user.name %>님 환영합니다.
        </span>

        |
        <a href="/user/logout">
            로그아웃
        </a>

    </div>

</header>

<nav class="menu">

    <a href="/">홈</a>
    <a href="/product">추천상품</a>
    <a href="/product/all">전체상품</a>
    <a href="/cart">장바구니</a>
    <a href="/order">주문내역</a>
    <a href="/board">고객센터</a>

</nav>

<div class="page-title">

    <h1>✏️ 게시글 수정</h1>

    <p>
        게시글 내용을 수정합니다.
    </p>

</div>

<div class="write-container">

    <form action="/board/edit/<%= post.id %>" method="post">

        <input
                type="text"
                name="title"
                class="input-title"
                value="<%= post.title %>"
                required
        >

        <br><br>

        <textarea
                name="content"
                class="input-content"
                required
        ><%= post.content %></textarea>

        <br><br>

        <button
                type="submit"
                class="save-btn"
        >
            수정 완료
        </button>

        <a
                href="/board/detail/<%= post.id %>"
                class="cancel-btn"
        >
            취소
        </a>

    </form>

</div>

</body>
</html>